OL,3,ACodebreaker, 103, kept his WW2 heroics
OL,4,Aa secret for decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut research into the life story of
OL,7,FVanke, now living in Breaston,
OL,8,FDerbyshire, has written a new chapter
OL,9,Fon the history of Bletchley Park's
OL,10,Ffamed codebreakers.
